<view class="{{styles.workbench}}" aria-labelledby="orchestrator-title">
  <text></text>
  <view class="{{styles.hero}}">
    <text></text>
    <view>
      <text></text>
      <text class="{{styles.eyebrow}}">
        <text>Repository task decomposition · cost router</text>
      </text>
      <text></text>
      <view id="orchestrator-title">
        <text>仓库任务编排预检</text>
      </view>
      <text></text>
      <view>
        <text>在创建任何运行之前，锁定模型选择、检查风险下限，并说明 DAG、成本与证据的真实就绪度。</text>
      </view>
      <text></text>
    </view>
    <text></text>
    <view class="{{styles.boundary}}" aria-label="执行边界">
      <text></text>
      <text>
        <text>Planning only</text>
      </text>
      <text></text>
      <text>
        <text>无 Provider 调用 · 无 Run · 无 SCM 副作用</text>
      </text>
      <text></text>
      <text>
        <text>外部执行 NOT_RUN · 认证 NOT_CERTIFIED</text>
      </text>
      <text></text>
    </view>
    <text></text>
  </view>
  <text></text>
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="{{styles.notice}}" role="status">
    <text>正在从后端加载唯一模型目录…</text>
  </view>
  <view wx:else />
  <text></text>
  <view wx:if="{{catalogError}}" class="{{styles.error}}" role="alert">
    <text>{{catalogError}}</text>
  </view>
  <view wx:else />
  <text></text>
  <view wx:if="{{catalog}}">
    <text></text>
    <view class="{{styles.catalogSection}}" aria-labelledby="execution-model-heading">
      <text></text>
      <view class="{{styles.sectionHeader}}">
        <text></text>
        <view>
          <text></text>
          <text class="{{styles.eyebrow}}">
            <text>Immutable selection ·</text>
            <text>{{catalog.catalogVersion}}</text>
          </text>
          <text></text>
          <view id="execution-model-heading">
            <text>执行模型</text>
          </view>
          <text></text>
        </view>
        <text></text>
        <text class="{{styles.status}}" data-tone="{{statusTone(catalog.status)}}">
          <text>{{catalog.status}}</text>
        </text>
        <text></text>
      </view>
      <text></text>
      <view wx:if="{{catalog.reasons.length > 0}}" class="{{styles.catalogReasons}}" role="status">
        <text></text>
        <text>
          <text>目录尚未就绪</text>
        </text>
        <text></text>
        <view>
          <view wx:for="{{catalog.reasons}}" wx:for-item="reason" wx:key="reason.id" key="{{reason}}">
            <text>{{readableReason(reason)}}</text>
          </view>
        </view>
        <text></text>
      </view>
      <view wx:else />
      <text></text>
      <fieldset class="{{styles.modeFieldset}}">
        <text></text>
        <legend class="sr-only">
          <text>选择 Smart 或手动模型模式</text>
        </legend>
        <text></text>
        <text class="{{`${styles.modeCard} ${mode === "smart" ? styles.selected : ""}`}}">
          <text></text>
          <input type="radio" name="execution-mode" value="smart" checked="{{mode === "smart"}}" bindchange="() => {
                    setMode("smart");
                    setSelectedModel(null);
                    setResult(null);
                  }" />
          <text></text>
          <text class="{{styles.modeCopy}}">
            <text></text>
            <text>
              <text>
                <text>Smart — 每个任务的最佳价值</text>
              </text>
              <text>
                <text>推荐</text>
              </text>
            </text>
            <text></text>
            <text>
              <text>后端在固定目录内按原子任务、风险下限与成本性能独立路由。</text>
            </text>
            <text></text>
          </text>
          <text></text>
        </text>
        <text></text>
        <text class="{{`${styles.modeCard} ${mode === "manual" ? styles.selected : ""}`}}">
          <text></text>
          <input type="radio" name="execution-mode" value="manual" checked="{{mode === "manual"}}" bindchange="() => {
                    setMode("manual");
                    setResult(null);
                  }" />
          <text></text>
          <text class="{{styles.modeCopy}}">
            <text></text>
            <text>
              <text>
                <text>手动选择主实现模型</text>
              </text>
              <text>
                <text>严格锁定</text>
              </text>
            </text>
            <text></text>
            <text>
              <text>默认不会静默切换；必需的独立验证仍可由系统策略指定。</text>
            </text>
            <text></text>
          </text>
          <text></text>
        </text>
        <text></text>
      </fieldset>
      <text></text>
      <view class="{{styles.modelGrid}}" aria-label="后端模型目录">
        <text></text>
        <text wx:for="{{catalog.models}}" wx:for-item="model" wx:key="model.id" class="{{`${styles.modelCard} ${selectedModel === model.alias ? styles.selectedModel : ""}`}}" key="{{model.alias}}" title="{{model.reasons.map(readableReason).join("; ")}}">
          <text></text>
          <text class="{{styles.modelTitle}}">
            <text></text>
            <input type="radio" name="manual-model" value="{{model.alias}}" disabled="{{mode !== "manual" || !model.selectable}}" checked="{{selectedModel === model.alias}}" bindchange="() => {
                        setSelectedModel(model.alias);
                        setResult(null);
                      }" />
            <text></text>
            <text>
              <text>
                <text>{{model.displayName}}</text>
              </text>
              <code>
                <text>{{model.alias}}</text>
              </code>
            </text>
            <text></text>
          </text>
          <text></text>
          <text class="{{styles.modelMeta}}">
            <text></text>
            <text>
              <text>{{model.provider}}</text>
            </text>
            <text></text>
            <text>
              <text>Cost</text>
              <text>{{model.relativeCostTier}}</text>
              <text>/5</text>
            </text>
            <text></text>
            <text>
              <text>{{model.highestRoutingTier}}</text>
            </text>
            <text></text>
          </text>
          <text></text>
          <text>
            <text>{{model.roleHint.replaceAll("_", " ")}}</text>
          </text>
          <text></text>
          <text class="{{styles.unavailable}}">
            <text>{{model.status}}</text>
          </text>
          <text></text>
          <view>
            <text></text>
            <view wx:for="{{model.reasons.slice(0, 3)}}" wx:for-item="reason" wx:key="reason.id" key="{{reason}}">
              <text>{{readableReason(reason)}}</text>
            </view>
            <text></text>
          </view>
          <text></text>
        </text>
        <text></text>
      </view>
      <text></text>
      <view class="{{styles.policyRow}}">
        <text></text>
        <text wx:if="{{mode === "manual"}}" class="{{styles.toggle}}">
          <text></text>
          <input type="checkbox" checked="{{fallbackEnabled}}" bindchange="(event) => {
                      setFallbackEnabled(event.target.checked);
                      setResult(null);
                    }" />
          <text></text>
          <text>
            <text>模型失败时允许 allowlist 内智能 fallback</text>
          </text>
          <text></text>
        </text>
        <view wx:else class="{{styles.routerPolicy}}">
          <text></text>
          <text>
            <text>Smart 使用服务端 router policy</text>
          </text>
          <text></text>
          <text>
            <text>调用方不能关闭强制风险门、预算硬停止或有界升级策略。</text>
          </text>
          <text></text>
        </view>
        <text></text>
        <text>
          <text></text>
          <text>
            <text>优化策略</text>
          </text>
          <text></text>
          <select value="{{optimizationProfile}}" bindchange="(event) => setOptimizationProfile(event.target.value as RepositoryPreflightRequest["optimizationProfile"])">
            <text></text>
            <option wx:for="{{catalog.optimizationProfiles}}" wx:for-item="profile" wx:key="profile.id" key="{{profile}}">
              <text>{{profile}}</text>
            </option>
            <text></text>
          </select>
          <text></text>
        </text>
        <text></text>
        <text>
          <text></text>
          <text>
            <text>验证策略</text>
          </text>
          <text></text>
          <select value="{{verificationPolicy}}" bindchange="(event) => setVerificationPolicy(event.target.value as RepositoryPreflightRequest["verificationPolicy"])">
            <text></text>
            <option wx:for="{{catalog.verificationPolicies}}" wx:for-item="policy" wx:key="policy.id" key="{{policy}}">
              <text>{{policy}}</text>
            </option>
            <text></text>
          </select>
          <text></text>
        </text>
        <text></text>
      </view>
      <text></text>
    </view>
    <text></text>
    <view class="{{styles.riskSection}}" aria-labelledby="risk-heading">
      <text></text>
      <view class="{{styles.sectionHeader}}">
        <text></text>
        <view>
          <text class="{{styles.eyebrow}}">
            <text>Risk gates before ranking</text>
          </text>
          <view id="risk-heading">
            <text>风险下限</text>
          </view>
        </view>
        <text></text>
        <text>
          <text>高风险至少 L3；长周期任务至少 L4。</text>
        </text>
        <text></text>
      </view>
      <text></text>
      <view class="{{styles.riskGrid}}">
        <text></text>
        <text wx:for="{{([
                ["security", "安全"],
                ["dataMigration", "数据迁移"],
                ["concurrency", "并发"],
                ["publicContract", "公共契约"],
                ["blastRadius", "爆炸半径"],
              ] as const)}}" wx:for-item="[field, label]" wx:key="[field, label].id" key="{{field}}">
          <text></text>
          <text>
            <text>{{label}}</text>
          </text>
          <text></text>
          <select value="{{risk[field]}}" bindchange="(event) => updateRisk(field, event.target.value as RepositoryRiskLevel)">
            <text></text>
            <option wx:for="{{riskOptions}}" wx:for-item="level" wx:key="level.id" key="{{level}}">
              <text>{{level}}</text>
            </option>
            <text></text>
          </select>
          <text></text>
        </text>
        <text></text>
        <text class="{{styles.longHorizon}}">
          <text></text>
          <input type="checkbox" checked="{{risk.longHorizon}}" bindchange="(event) => {
                    setRisk((current) => ({ ...current, longHorizon: event.target.checked }));
                    setResult(null);
                  }" />
          <text></text>
          <text>
            <text>长周期迁移 / long horizon</text>
          </text>
          <text></text>
        </text>
        <text></text>
      </view>
      <text></text>
      <view class="{{styles.preflightAction}}">
        <text></text>
        <view>
          <text></text>
          <view wx:if="{{mode === "manual" && !selectedDescriptor?.selectable}}" />
          <view wx:else />
          <text></text>
        </view>
        <text></text>
        <button type="button" disabled="{{!canPreflight}}" bindtap="() => void submitPreflight()">
          <text></text>
          <view wx:if="{{submitting}}" />
          <view wx:else />
          <text></text>
        </button>
        <text></text>
      </view>
      <text></text>
      <view wx:if="{{preflightError}}" class="{{styles.error}}" role="alert">
        <text>{{preflightError}}</text>
      </view>
      <view wx:else />
      <text></text>
    </view>
    <text></text>
    <view wx:if="{{result}}" class="{{styles.resultSection}}" aria-labelledby="preflight-result-heading" aria-live="polite">
      <text></text>
      <view class="{{styles.sectionHeader}}">
        <text></text>
        <view>
          <text class="{{styles.eyebrow}}">
            <text>Preflight decision</text>
          </text>
          <view id="preflight-result-heading">
            <text>预检结果</text>
          </view>
        </view>
        <text></text>
        <text class="{{styles.status}}" data-tone="{{statusTone(result.status)}}">
          <text>{{result.status}}</text>
        </text>
        <text></text>
      </view>
      <text></text>
      <view class="{{styles.readinessGrid}}">
        <text></text>
        <view>
          <text></text>
          <text>
            <text>模型配置</text>
          </text>
          <text>
            <text>{{result.configurationStatus}}</text>
          </text>
          <text></text>
          <text>
            <text>风险下限</text>
            <text>{{result.minimumRoutingTier}}</text>
            <text>· resolved</text>
            <text>{{result.resolvedModel ?? "none"}}</text>
          </text>
          <text></text>
        </view>
        <text></text>
        <view>
          <text></text>
          <text>
            <text>任务 DAG</text>
          </text>
          <text>
            <text>{{result.dag.status}}</text>
          </text>
          <text></text>
          <text>
            <text>{{result.dag.tasks.length}}</text>
            <text>tasks ·</text>
            <text>{{result.dag.waves.length}}</text>
            <text>waves</text>
          </text>
          <text></text>
        </view>
        <text></text>
        <view>
          <text></text>
          <text>
            <text>成本估算</text>
          </text>
          <text>
            <text>{{result.cost.status}}</text>
          </text>
          <text></text>
          <text>
            <view wx:if="{{result.cost.estimatedRunCost === null}}" />
            <view wx:else />
          </text>
          <text></text>
        </view>
        <text></text>
        <view>
          <text></text>
          <text>
            <text>认证</text>
          </text>
          <text>
            <text>{{result.evidence.certification}}</text>
          </text>
          <text></text>
          <text>
            <text>external</text>
            <text>{{result.evidence.externalVerification}}</text>
          </text>
          <text></text>
        </view>
        <text></text>
      </view>
      <text></text>
      <view class="{{styles.resultColumns}}">
        <text></text>
        <view>
          <text></text>
          <view>
            <text>阻断与配置原因</text>
          </view>
          <text></text>
          <view>
            <view wx:for="{{result.reasons}}" wx:for-item="reason" wx:key="reason.id" key="{{reason}}">
              <text>{{readableReason(reason)}}</text>
            </view>
          </view>
          <text></text>
          <view>
            <text>{{result.cost.reason}}</text>
          </view>
          <text></text>
        </view>
        <text></text>
        <view>
          <text></text>
          <view>
            <text>DAG 就绪度</text>
          </view>
          <text></text>
          <view>
            <view wx:for="{{result.dag.requiredStages}}" wx:for-item="stage" wx:key="stage.id" key="{{stage}}">
              <text>{{readableReason(stage)}}</text>
            </view>
          </view>
          <text></text>
          <view>
            <text>{{result.dag.reason}}</text>
          </view>
          <text></text>
        </view>
        <text></text>
        <view>
          <text></text>
          <view>
            <text>不可变选择与审计解释</text>
          </view>
          <text></text>
          <code wx:if="{{result.selection}}" class="{{styles.digest}}">
            <text>{{result.selection.digest}}</text>
          </code>
          <view wx:else />
          <text></text>
          <view>
            <view wx:for="{{result.auditExplanation}}" wx:key="item.id" key="{{item}}">
              <text>{{item}}</text>
            </view>
          </view>
          <text></text>
        </view>
        <text></text>
      </view>
      <text></text>
      <view class="{{styles.evidenceStrip}}" aria-label="副作用与证据状态">
        <text></text>
        <text wx:for="{{Object.entries(result.evidence)}}" wx:for-item="[key, value]" wx:key="[key, value].id" key="{{key}}">
          <text>
            <text>{{key}}</text>
          </text>
          <text>
            <text>{{value}}</text>
          </text>
        </text>
        <text></text>
      </view>
      <text></text>
    </view>
    <view wx:else />
    <text></text>
    <text></text>
    <text></text>
    <view class="mt-8 p-5 rounded-xl border border-border bg-card/60 shadow-lg" aria-labelledby="pipeline-sandbox-heading">
      <text></text>
      <view class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
        <text></text>
        <view>
          <text></text>
          <text class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-primary font-mono font-semibold">
            <text>INTERACTIVE PIPELINE SANDBOX</text>
          </text>
          <text></text>
          <view id="pipeline-sandbox-heading" class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground">
            <text>跨引擎全自动现代化流水线沙箱</text>
          </view>
          <text></text>
        </view>
        <text></text>
        <text class="px-2 py-0.5 text-xs rounded bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 font-mono border border-emerald-500/30">
          <text>ELMOS v3.0.0</text>
        </text>
        <text></text>
      </view>
      <text></text>
      <view class="text-xs text-muted-foreground mb-4">
        <text>在 Web 控制台中实时体验从</text>
        <text>
          <text>源码摄取</text>
        </text>
        <text>、</text>
        <text>
          <text>多语言 AST 语义降级</text>
        </text>
        <text>、</text>
        <text>
          <text>SMT 形式化证明</text>
        </text>
        <text>、</text>
        <text>
          <text>差分 Fuzzing</text>
        </text>
        <text>到</text>
        <text>
          <text>FinOps 计量</text>
        </text>
        <text>和</text>
        <text>
          <text>SLSA Level 3 数字回执</text>
        </text>
        <text>的全生命周期流转。</text>
      </view>
      <text></text>
      <view class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-6 gap-2 mb-4">
        <text></text>
        <view wx:for="{{[
                { step: "1", title: "源码摄取与解析", status: "INGESTED", desc: "AST 抽象树提取与依赖图" },
                { step: "2", title: "Polyglot 语义转换", status: "TRANSFORMED", desc: "784 路线精确语义重写" },
                { step: "3", title: "SMT 形式化验证", status: "SAT_PROVED", desc: "Z3/CVC5 不可判定项证明" },
                { step: "4", title: "差分 Fuzzing", status: "FUZZ_PASSED", desc: "双向行为与边界测试" },
                { step: "5", title: "FinOps 计量", status: "METERED", desc: "Token与实时成本核算" },
                { step: "6", title: "SLSA 证据回执", status: "CERTIFIED", desc: "Merkle 防篡改数字防伪" },
              ]}}" wx:for-item="s" wx:key="s.id" key="{{s.step}}" class="p-3 rounded-lg border border-border/80 bg-background/50 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <text></text>
          <view>
            <text></text>
            <view class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1">
              <text></text>
              <text class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-primary/20 text-primary text-xs flex items-center justify-center font-bold">
                <text>{{s.step}}</text>
              </text>
              <text></text>
              <text class="text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 font-mono font-semibold">
                <text>{{s.status}}</text>
              </text>
              <text></text>
            </view>
            <text></text>
            <text class="text-xs text-foreground block">
              <text>{{s.title}}</text>
            </text>
            <text></text>
          </view>
          <text></text>
          <text class="text-[11px] text-muted-foreground mt-1">
            <text>{{s.desc}}</text>
          </text>
          <text></text>
        </view>
        <text></text>
      </view>
      <text></text>
      <view class="p-4 rounded-lg bg-background border border-border flex flex-col gap-2">
        <text></text>
        <view class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-muted-foreground font-mono">
          <text></text>
          <text>
            <text>CLI 一键触发命令：</text>
          </text>
          <text></text>
          <text class="text-emerald-400">
            <text>Action Cache: ENABLED (SHA-256 CAS)</text>
          </text>
          <text></text>
        </view>
        <text></text>
        <code class="text-xs text-primary font-mono bg-muted/30 p-2 rounded block overflow-x-auto">
          <text>elmos pipeline --src-lang java --tgt-lang csharp --code &quot;public class AccountLedger &amp;#123; public double balance; &amp;#125;&quot; --export-html report.html</text>
        </code>
        <text></text>
      </view>
      <text></text>
    </view>
    <text></text>
  </view>
  <view wx:else />
  <text></text>
</view>
